= Results <ch:results>

== Use

The scheme recorded 61,400 trips, half as many again as the goal of 40,000. @fig:trips shows trips per day
through the year. Use follows the teaching terms closely and falls in winter, as expected from studies of
weather and cycling @gebhart2014impact, but it never dropped below 60 trips a day during term.

#figure(
  image("../figures/daily-trips.png", width: 85%),
