== Cost

Using @eq:cost, the scheme cost £23,300 for the year, or 38 pence per trip. The shuttle cost 94 pence per
passenger journey over the same period. The scheme therefore meets the second goal with a wide margin, even
if the staff time spent moving bicycles between stations were to double.

== Effect on Car Travel

Of survey respondents, 16% said they would have driven or taken a taxi for their most recent trip. Applied to
all trips, that is about 9,800 car journeys replaced, most of them between the two campuses. Counts at the
science campus car park fell by 7% compared with the previous year, which is consistent with this estimate,
although other changes in the same year mean the fall cannot be attributed to the scheme alone.

== Summary Against the Goals

All three goals set out in @sec:goals were met: use exceeded the target by 53%, the cost per trip was 40% of
the shuttle's, and roughly one trip in six replaced a car journey.
